      "*": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Events</b> are occurrences that happen in <i><a href=\"/wiki/Potion_Maker\" title=\"Potion Maker\">Potion Maker</a></i>. When there is an event, an icon show <i>New Event</i> will shown at the top left corner of the screen (below <a href=\"/wiki/Materials\" title=\"Materials\">materials</a> conveyor, and above <a href=\"/wiki/Quests\" title=\"Quests\">quest</a> icons). In an event there may be some <a href=\"/wiki/Request#Event_request\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Request\">Event Requests</a>, Event <a href=\"/wiki/Costumes\" title=\"Costumes\">Costumes</a> or other enhancements. From <a href=\"/wiki/Version_history#2.2.3\" title=\"Version history\">version 2.2.3</a> onward, events are downloaded using the <a href=\"/wiki/Event_download_system\" title=\"Event download system\">event download system</a> instead of being included with the game. All events award event-exclusive costumes, some of which can be purchased after an event with <span class=\"mw-default-size mw-valign-top\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span title=\"Ruby\"><img alt=\"Ruby\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/a/aa/Gem.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/14?cb=20150721185508\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"14\" height=\"18\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Gem.png\" data-image-key=\"Gem.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span>Rubies.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Event_types\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Event types</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Request_Events\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Request Events</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Collection_events\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Collection events</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#List_of_Events\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">List of Events</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Event_types\">Event types</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpotionmaker.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEvents%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Request_Events\">Request Events</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpotionmaker.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEvents%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>These event involve special event <a href=\"/wiki/Requests\" title=\"Requests\">requests</a>, which differ from normal requests. Special event requests have the same percentage chance of success regardless of the <a href=\"/wiki/Travelers\" title=\"Travelers\">traveler</a>'s level. Event requests will always start off with a price of 1,000 coins, then will increase the price by 1,000 coins with each subsequent request.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Collection_events\">Collection events</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpotionmaker.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEvents%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>These events involve collecting special materials that appear on the conveyor. These materials, when tapped, do not become part of the potion, but will be collected instead, and count toward the total amount needed to obtain a costume.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"List_of_Events\">List of Events</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpotionmaker.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEvents%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Event Name\n</th>\n<th>Start Time\n</th>\n<th>End Time\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Costumes\" title=\"Costumes\">Costume</a> reward\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cherry Blossom Event\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>Pio's <a href=\"/wiki/Costumes#Sakura_Sailor_Suit_(Pink)\" title=\"Costumes\">Sakura Sailor Suit (Pink)</a><br />Pio's <a href=\"/wiki/Costumes#Sakura_Sailor_Suit_(Navy_blue)\" title=\"Costumes\">Sakura Sailor Suit (Navy blue)</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>New Semester Event\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>2015 March 31\n</td>\n<td>Pio's <a href=\"/wiki/Costumes#School_Uniform_(Navy_blue)\" title=\"Costumes\">School Uniform (Navy blue)</a><br />Pio's <a href=\"/wiki/Costumes#School_Uniform\" title=\"Costumes\">School Uniform</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>100,000 Download Event\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>2015 May 9\n</td>\n<td>Tia's <a href=\"/wiki/Costumes#Maid_(Blue)\" title=\"Costumes\">Maid (Blue)</a><br />Tia's <a href=\"/wiki/Costumes#Maid_(Black)\" title=\"Costumes\">Maid (black)</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Season_2_update_event\" title=\"Season 2 update event\">Season 2 Update Event</a>\n</td>\n<td>2015 May 17\n</td>\n<td>2015 Jun 1\n</td>\n<td>Pio's <a href=\"/wiki/Costumes#Bunny_Girl_(Black)\" title=\"Costumes\">Bunny Girl (Black)</a><br />Pio's <a href=\"/wiki/Costumes#Bunny_Girl_(Red)\" title=\"Costumes\">Bunny Girl (Red)</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Mystic_Alchemy_Lab_event\" title=\"Mystic Alchemy Lab event\">Mystic Alchemy Lab Event</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>2015 May 31\n</td>\n<td>Tia's <a href=\"/wiki/Costumes#Sukumizu_(Black)\" title=\"Costumes\">Sukumizu (Black)</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Halak_Birthday_event\" title=\"Halak Birthday event\">Halak Birthday Event</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>2015 Jun 24\n</td>\n<td>Pio's <a href=\"/wiki/Costumes#Summer_Dress_(Skyblue)\" title=\"Costumes\">Summer Dress (Skyblue)</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/300000_DL_Thanks_event\" title=\"300000 DL Thanks event\">300000 DL Thanks Event</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>2015 July 11\n</td>\n<td>Tia's <a href=\"/wiki/Costumes#Nurse_(Red)\" title=\"Costumes\">Nurse (Red)</a><br />Tia's <a href=\"/wiki/Costumes#Nurse_(White)\" title=\"Costumes\">Nurse (White)</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/2015_Summer_Event_Part._1\" title=\"2015 Summer Event Part. 1\">2015 Summer Event Part. 1</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>2015 July 31\n</td>\n<td>Pio's <a href=\"/wiki/Costumes#Frill_Bikini_(Green)\" title=\"Costumes\">Frill Bikini (Green)</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/2015_Summer_Event_Part._2\" title=\"2015 Summer Event Part. 2\">2015 Summer Event Part. 2</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>2015 August 15\n</td>\n<td>Tia's <a href=\"/wiki/Costumes#Sports_Bikini_.28Green.29\" title=\"Costumes\">Sports Bikini (Green)</a><br />Tia's <a href=\"/wiki/Costumes#Sports_Bikini_.28Navy.29\" title=\"Costumes\">Sports Bikini (Navy)</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/2015_Summer_Event_Part._3\" title=\"2015 Summer Event Part. 3\">2015 Summer Event Part. 3</a>\n</td>\n<td>2015 August 16\n</td>\n<td>2015 August 31\n</td>\n<td>Tia's <a href=\"/wiki/Costumes#Cami_Dress_(Pink)\" title=\"Costumes\">Cami Dress (Pink)</a><br />Pio's <a href=\"/wiki/Costumes#Summer_Dress_(White)\" title=\"Costumes\">Summer Dress (White)</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Succubus_appeared!\" title=\"Succubus appeared!\">Succubus appeared!</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>2015 September 15\n</td>\n<td>Pio's Succubus suit (Black)<br />\n<p>Pio's Succubus suit (Red)\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><i>(Note: Starting time are from 00:00 UTC+9 and Ending time are until 23:59 UTC+9)</i>\n</p>\n<table class=\"navtemplate\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"background:#cc9933\" colspan=\"2\"><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Events</strong>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th width=\"64px\" style=\"background:#ddd\"><abbr title=\"These events were included as part of the game itself.\" style=\"border-bottom: 1px dotted; cursor: help;\">Pre-download system</abbr>\n</th>\n<td style=\"background:#dd\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Cherry Blossom event (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2hlcnJ5X0Jsb3Nzb21fZXZlbnQ/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Cherry Blossom event</span> &#8226; <a href=\"/wiki/Season_2_update_event\" title=\"Season 2 update event\">Season 2 update event</a> &#8226; <a href=\"/wiki/Mystic_Alchemy_Lab_event\" title=\"Mystic Alchemy Lab event\">Mystic Alchemy Lab event</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th width=\"64px\" style=\"background:#ddd\"><abbr title=\"These events are not included as part of the game. They use the new event download system introduced in the version 2.2.3 update.\" style=\"border-bottom: 1px dotted; cursor: help;\">Post-download system</abbr>\n</th>\n<td style=\"background:#dd\"><a href=\"/wiki/Halak_Birthday_event\" title=\"Halak Birthday event\">Halak Birthday event</a> &#8226; <a href=\"/wiki/300000_DL_Thanks_event\" title=\"300000 DL Thanks event\">300000 DL Thanks event</a> &#8226; <a href=\"/wiki/2015_Summer_Event_Part._1\" title=\"2015 Summer Event Part. 1\">2015 Summer Event Part. 1</a> &#8226; <a href=\"/wiki/2015_Summer_Event_Part._2\" title=\"2015 Summer Event Part. 2\">2015 Summer Event Part. 2</a> &#8226; <a href=\"/wiki/2015_Summer_Event_Part._3\" title=\"2015 Summer Event Part. 3\">2015 Summer Event Part. 3</a> &#8226; <a href=\"/wiki/Succubus_appeared!\" title=\"Succubus appeared!\">Succubus appeared!</a> &#8226; <a href=\"/wiki/Fox_burrow_Open!\" title=\"Fox burrow Open!\">Fox burrow Open!</a> &#8226; <a href=\"/wiki/2015_Halloween_Party\" title=\"2015 Halloween Party\">2015 Halloween Party</a>&#8226; <a href=\"/wiki/500000_DL_Thanks_Event\" title=\"500000 DL Thanks Event\">500000 DL Thanks Event</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td><div align=\"center\"><b>This template is missing data from past events.<br />Know any? Leave a suggestion <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://potionmaker.fandom.com/wiki/Template_talk:Navbox-events?action=edit&amp;section=new&amp;useeditor=source\">here</a>, or <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://potionmaker.fandom.com/wiki/Template:Navbox-events?action=edit&amp;useeditor=source\">edit this template</a> yourself.</b></div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261012134232\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.019 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.045 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 46/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1568/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    4.391      1 -total\n 35.43%    1.556      1 Template:Navbox-events\n 31.02%    1.362      1 Template:PM\n 29.57%    1.298      1 Template:Ruby\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_potionmaker783:pcache:idhash:2597-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20261012134232 and revision id 5450. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"
